[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/resources/ActionEnemyData.gd" id="1"]

; Monstro — the Basement boss. Authored from The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth's
; behaviour: he idles, then picks one action at a time (boss_brain) — a big
; airborne jump that slams onto the player and rains tears (LEAP), or a standing
; vomit volley (RANGED fan). Numbers are our-scale placeholders tuned from the
; game's state timing; refine freely. Renders as a fleshy circle until the sprite
; frames are dropped in (idle/jump/airborne/land/attack) — see
; docs/action-enemy-authoring.md.

